    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**1.** 直径$D=0.8$毫米的黄铜导线，长$L=3.6$米. 在力$F=25$牛顿的作用下，导线伸长$\\Delta l=2$毫米. 试求黄铜的杨氏模量.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 125,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0134#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "**1.** 直径$D=0.8$毫米的黄铜导线，长$L=3.6$米. 在力$F=25$牛顿的作用下，导线伸长$\\Delta l=2$毫米. 试求黄铜的杨氏模量.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**解：** 根据胡克定律公式$\\sigma=E\\cdot|\\varepsilon|$，求得$E=\\frac{\\sigma}{|\\varepsilon|}$，或者，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 125,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0134#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "**解：** 根据胡克定律公式$\\sigma=E\\cdot|\\varepsilon|$，求得$E=\\frac{\\sigma}{|\\varepsilon|}$，或者，",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "考虑到$\\sigma=\\frac{F}{S}$和$|\\varepsilon|=\\frac{|\\Delta l|}{l_0}$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 125,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0134#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "考虑到$\\sigma=\\frac{F}{S}$和$|\\varepsilon|=\\frac{|\\Delta l|}{l_0}$，",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$E=\\frac{Fl_0}{S\\cdot|\\Delta l|}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 125,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0134#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$E=\\frac{Fl_0}{S\\cdot|\\Delta l|}$.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$S=\\frac{\\pi D^2}{4}$，所以，$E=\\frac{4Fl_0}{\\pi D^2\\cdot|\\Delta l|}$；",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 125,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0134#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为$S=\\frac{\\pi D^2}{4}$，所以，$E=\\frac{4Fl_0}{\\pi D^2\\cdot|\\Delta l|}$；",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$E=9\\times10^{10}$牛顿/米$^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 125,
      "source_refs": [
