      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
  "schema": "ld-s10y-lesson/edition-lesson@1",
  "edition": "modern-us-neutral",
  "status": "draft",
  "source": {
    "path": "lessons/phy9-c1-s6-n54/lesson.json",
    "sha256": "c3a6df77bd20269dc1559f0e974b505c24647c1f4a39e9bda60b0893e7ef9f68",
    "data": {
      "id": "phy9-c1-s6-n54",
      "card_id": "phy9-c1-s6-n54",
      "chapter": "第六章 固体和固-液转变",
      "section": null,
      "number": "54",
      "title": "晶体的熔解和液体的凝固",
      "printed_title": "54. 晶体的熔解和液体的凝固",
      "start_page": 132,
      "start_printed": 123,
      "figures": [],
      "exercise_count": 0,
      "prose": [
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "正如你们在七年级物理课中知道的，晶体的熔解是在严格确定的温度下进行的. 例如，在标准大气压下，冰在$0^\\circ\\text{C}$时熔解，水银在$-39^\\circ\\text{C}$凝固，锡在$232^\\circ\\text{C}$时熔解.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 123,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0132#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "为了使物体熔解，必须传给物体热量. 如果不再传递热量，把固体—液体系统孤立起来，则这个系统将保持平衡：晶态和液态物质的质量不再改变. 如果系统向周围较冷的物体放出热量，就开始了熔解的逆过程——**结晶**. 此时温度也是恒定的，并等于熔解温度.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 123,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0132#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "随着晶体的加热，它的分子平均能量增加，主要是增加平均动能. 由于加热时物体膨胀，分子间距离增大，所以分子间相互作用的势能也增加一点. 达到熔解温度以后，传给它的所有能量都用来增加分子的势能，因为在温度恒定时它们的动能保持不变. 这个势能的增加是很大的，因为当熔解时几乎所有的物体都是体积增大很多，从而分子间的距离增大.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 123,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0132#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**在熔解温度下，1千克晶体物质转变为同温度的液体所需要的热量$\\lambda$，叫做熔解热.**",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 123,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0132#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "结晶时，1千克物质放出相同的热量. 这是能量守恒定律的推论. 这就是一般所说的下雪时变暖的原因. 冰的熔解热相当大：$3.4\\times10^5$焦耳/千克$=80$卡/克. 假如冰熔解不需要给它能量，那么其后果是很糟糕的. 当春天温度刚刚达到$0^\\circ\\text{C}$时，冰和雪在几分钟或几秒钟之内就全部变成了水. 形成强大的水流，流到我们的道路上.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 123,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0132#8",
            "p0133#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "为了使质量为$m$的晶体熔解，需要热量",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 124,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0133#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$Q_{\\text{熔}}=\\lambda m$. (6-7)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 124,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0133#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "当物体结晶时放出热量",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 124,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0133#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$Q_{\\text{结}}=-\\lambda m$. (6-8)",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 124,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0133#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "当温度远低于临界温度时，物质的汽化热远大于熔解热.例如，$100^\\circ\\text{C}$的水的汽化热为$L=2.26\\times10^6$焦耳/千克，而$0^\\circ\\text{C}$的水的熔解热为$\\lambda=3.4\\times10^5$焦耳/千克. 这说明：在温度远低于临界温度时，物质的液态更接近于晶态.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 124,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0133#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "大多数的物质的熔点随着压强的增大而升高，与沸点随着压强增大而升高相类似. 这可以这样来解释：物质受压缩时阻碍了分子间距离的增大，因此，增大了为转变成液态所需要的分子相互作用势能.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 124,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0133#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "一些物质：冰、铋等，熔解时体积减小，从而密度增大(假如不是这样，则冰就沉到水中，而不漂浮). 这些物质在压强增大时熔点降低. 这种特性与晶体结构的特殊形状有关，在这种结构下，分子有秩序排列所占有的体积大于无秩序排列所占有的体积. 但是，这些物质在熔解时，分子的势能增大.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 124,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0133#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在密闭容器里结冰的水膨胀时，产生巨大的力，可以使厚壁的铁球破裂. 用盛满水的玻璃瓶可以做类似的实验. 把瓶放在严寒的地方. 在水表面形成一个冰的瓶塞，塞住瓶子，从而，在结冰的水膨胀时，瓶子被涨破.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 124,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0133#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在严寒的季节，水结冰引起岩石逐渐地破裂.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**例题**",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**1.** 直径$D=0.8$毫米的黄铜导线，长$L=3.6$米. 在力$F=25$牛顿的作用下，导线伸长$\\Delta l=2$毫米. 试求黄铜的杨氏模量.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**解：** 根据胡克定律公式$\\sigma=E\\cdot|\\varepsilon|$，求得$E=\\frac{\\sigma}{|\\varepsilon|}$，或者，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "考虑到$\\sigma=\\frac{F}{S}$和$|\\varepsilon|=\\frac{|\\Delta l|}{l_0}$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$E=\\frac{Fl_0}{S\\cdot|\\Delta l|}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因为$S=\\frac{\\pi D^2}{4}$，所以，$E=\\frac{4Fl_0}{\\pi D^2\\cdot|\\Delta l|}$；",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$E=9\\times10^{10}$牛顿/米$^2$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**2.** 把质量$m_2=0.4$千克、温度$t_2=0^\\circ\\text{C}$的冰放到温度$t_1=75^\\circ\\text{C}$的铝制大容器中，建立热平衡以后，温度等于$t_3=50^\\circ\\text{C}$. 容器的质量$m_1$是多大？铝的比热$c_1=880$焦耳/(千克·度).**忽略水的蒸发.**",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**解：** 容器放出的热量",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$Q_1=c_1m_1(t_3-t_1)$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "是负的，因为$t_3<t_1$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "冰熔解所需的热量",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$Q_2=\\lambda m_2$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "而水从$0^\\circ\\text{C}$加热到$t_3$需要热量",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$Q_3=c_2m_2(t_3-t_2)$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 125,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0134#16"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "热平衡方程为",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$Q_1+Q_2+Q_3=0$，",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "或",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$c_1m_1(t_3-t_1)+\\lambda m_2+c_2m_2(t_3-t_2)=0$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由此得出",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$m_1=m_2\\frac{\\lambda+c_2(t_3-t_2)}{c_1(t_1-t_3)}$；",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "$m_1=10$千克.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**3.** 在量热器中盛有0.4千克、$10^\\circ\\text{C}$的水. 把0.6千克、$-40^\\circ\\text{C}$的冰放到水中. 如果量热器的热容量非常小，则量热器中平衡的温度是多大？",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "**解：** 水冷却到$0^\\circ\\text{C}$时所放出的热量等于$16.8\\times10^3$焦耳.为了使冰加热到$0^\\circ\\text{C}$需要热量$50.4\\times10^3$焦耳. 因此，只有依靠水结冰时所放出的热量冰才能加热. 为了放出$33.6\\times10^3$焦耳的热量，0.4千克的水应当有0.1千克结成冰. 由此可见，在量热器中是0.3千克的水和0.7千克的冰的混合物，热平衡的温度为$0^\\circ\\text{C}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 126,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0135#9"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
